    "text": "signshop.com\nwebsite\nWest Lafayette\nPurdue University Celebrates Engineering Greats with LED Video Wall from SNA Displays\nBy Alex Marcheschi,\n1 days agoDigital media design studio Exhibitry created an immersive art installation to celebrate the 150th anniversary of Purdue University’s College of Engineering using LED video technology from SNA Displays. Exhibitry designed the digital experience, located in the Herman & Heddy Kurz Atrium at Armstrong Hall, to represent the engineering college’s three core virtues: innovation, ingenuity, and vibrancy. The video wall uses anamorphic creative to feature three of the most consequential Purdue engineers: Neil Armstrong, Amelia Earhart, and Lillian Gilbreth, the “First Lady of Engineering.”\n1",
